    {
      "question": "e-7023",
      "field": null,
      "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
      "old_sha256": "870d0016787147de63bd909645cce03636f3aaf823282c6fbb3f95db557132eb",
      "new_sha256": "58cb451504bc6313c28a41d724b5850a99c77293b7cf825828e9b4f03cc6aa35",
      "category": "ma_capture",
      "authoring": [],
      "source": [
        {
          "question": "e-7023",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "Using the linearity and additivity of double integrals, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\u222c}_{C\\cup D}3f(x,y)\\text{\u00a0}\\text{d}A & =3{\u222c}_{C\\cup D}f(x,y)\\text{\u00a0}\\text{d}A \\\\  & =3({\u222c}_{C}f(x,y)\\text{\u00a0}\\text{d}A+{\u222c}_{D}f(x,y)\\text{\u00a0}\\text{d}A) \\\\  & =3(8+(-5)) \\\\  & =3\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
