        {
          "question": "e-6108",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Evaluate the double integral $\\displaystyle \\iint\\limits_{R}  f(x,y)\\ \\textrm d A$, where\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14054242/assets/d96ec9ab40f8f1cadd6d2492dddcc0090f766b72e9c7fdb659e3b2f7f39fce0d.png)\nand  $R$ is the domain of $f.$",
